{
  "uid": "wcl-d11-infra",
  "title": "Infra: Containers and telemetry pipeline",
  "description": "D11 (feature 058): container CPU and memory, Alloy drops and queues, backend ingest rates and active series against the 50k budget, through recording-rule aliases.",
